WEBVTT

00:15.820 --> 00:17.160
Five-Layer Guard!

00:21.970 --> 00:24.920
Now it won't be able to attack from the sky!

00:31.080 --> 00:31.910
I...

00:32.440 --> 00:34.500
have been bitten before,

00:35.480 --> 00:37.630
so I don't really like reptiles.

00:41.360 --> 00:43.270
Close that mouth of yours.

00:46.450 --> 00:48.310
It's so strange.

00:49.340 --> 00:51.400
I'm retired,

00:51.400 --> 00:54.240
I'm standing on the battlefield 
side-by-side with my enemy,

00:54.840 --> 00:58.710
and for the first time, I can 
fight with a Hero's heart.

00:59.820 --> 01:02.500
A united demon-human front, huh?

01:02.940 --> 01:04.080
That's not bad at all.

01:17.380 --> 01:18.830
Adamantine Thunderbolt!

01:30.240 --> 01:34.490
Flaming Gaol of Endless Searing Screams.

01:53.750 --> 01:58.050
<b>Chillin'</b>

01:53.750 --> 01:58.050
<b>in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

03:09.080 --> 03:12.080
<b>Episode 12</b>

03:09.080 --> 03:12.080
<b>Dariel Reaches Out His Hand.</b>

03:18.560 --> 03:19.590
<i>That form...</i>

03:20.840 --> 03:22.470
<i>is that an effect of the hex?</i>

03:33.480 --> 03:36.360
You're just an incompetent 
who can't use magic!

03:40.150 --> 03:41.150
But you always...

03:42.150 --> 03:44.660
smile like nothing bothers you!

03:44.970 --> 03:47.010
You're infuriating.

03:47.010 --> 03:47.660
And now...

03:48.160 --> 03:48.870
I can finally...

03:48.870 --> 03:50.490
be rid of you!

03:50.490 --> 03:51.120
I...

03:51.640 --> 03:53.220
wasn't like you...

03:53.220 --> 03:54.880
because I had nothing.

03:55.170 --> 03:56.890
That's what they all say...

03:57.900 --> 03:59.880
the ones who have everything!

04:00.140 --> 04:01.880
Let's just stop this!

04:01.880 --> 04:02.980
Stop talking!

04:03.880 --> 04:07.200
I am the General of the Transcendent 
Tempest, strongest of all...

04:07.200 --> 04:08.730
Bashbarza!

04:12.970 --> 04:16.380
Flaming Gaol of Endless Searing Screams!

04:19.480 --> 04:20.540
That's...

04:20.540 --> 04:21.570
I have to stop it!

04:30.280 --> 04:34.190
He used fire against a magical 
fire beast and took it down.

04:34.640 --> 04:36.080
Incredible.

04:37.850 --> 04:38.850
Is that...

04:39.670 --> 04:40.910
What is that?

04:46.080 --> 04:47.510
Lord Bashbarza!

04:56.240 --> 04:57.190
Big Bro!

05:15.720 --> 05:18.000
<i>Did that advance the progress of the hex?</i>

05:18.240 --> 05:20.030
<i>He's like a magical beast.</i>

05:24.150 --> 05:27.090
Da...ri...el!

05:36.640 --> 05:40.550
Please don't make your father 
grieve more than he already has!

05:41.510 --> 05:44.060
Y-You...

05:44.060 --> 05:47.650
don't speak... of my father!

06:00.510 --> 06:01.840
Lord Granbarza!

06:02.850 --> 06:04.840
Lord Granbarza!

06:05.160 --> 06:06.970
Lord Granbarza!

06:08.590 --> 06:10.260
This is amazing!

06:10.260 --> 06:14.290
One day, I want to be one of the 
Four Generals just like you, Father!

06:14.290 --> 06:18.720
Then you'll have to become General of the 
Transcendent Tempest, strongest of all.

06:19.540 --> 06:20.600
I will!

06:23.880 --> 06:24.940
<i>These are...</i>

06:25.490 --> 06:27.340
<i>Lord Bashbarza's memories!</i>

06:28.610 --> 06:32.590
<i>Now that the hex has progressed, 
is his synchronization magic spilling over?</i>

06:36.620 --> 06:38.120
<i>It happened when I was ten...</i>

06:39.510 --> 06:43.080
<i>on the day when my father, whom I only 
saw a few times a year, came home.</i>

06:44.880 --> 06:46.410
He has returned.

06:46.900 --> 06:48.960
I'll go! I'll go!

06:50.310 --> 06:51.840
Welcome hom—

06:52.540 --> 06:54.620
<i>I'd even gone out to welcome him,</i>

06:55.390 --> 06:58.600
<i>but there, standing beside 
my father... was you.</i>

06:59.890 --> 07:01.650
He's called Dariel.

07:02.280 --> 07:06.150
Rely on him like an older brother, and listen
 to him like you would me.

07:08.260 --> 07:09.710
An older brother?

07:09.710 --> 07:10.960
<i>It made me so sad.</i>

07:12.350 --> 07:14.860
<i>Because I realized that the time 
I spent waiting for my father,</i>

07:14.860 --> 07:17.950
<i>you spent with him, at his side.</i>

07:21.440 --> 07:24.170
Join the Demon King's Army so 
that you can be with your father?

07:24.450 --> 07:25.190
Yes.

07:25.190 --> 07:26.170
No.

07:26.470 --> 07:28.760
You will enroll in the Magic Academy.

07:28.760 --> 07:29.670
All right?

07:32.250 --> 07:34.180
Y-Yes.

07:37.020 --> 07:38.000
Um...

07:38.590 --> 07:42.360
If I manage to place first, 
there's something I'd like to ask of you.

07:42.360 --> 07:44.190
If you place first.

07:47.300 --> 07:49.140
<i>I graduated at the top of my class,</i>

07:49.140 --> 07:51.030
<i>and I was recommended to 
join the Four Generals.</i>

07:51.820 --> 07:54.220
<i>I could finally try to 
catch up with my father!</i>

07:54.220 --> 07:55.420
<i>That was what I thought.</i>

07:56.630 --> 07:57.660
<i>But...</i>

07:57.660 --> 07:59.290
You too?

08:00.620 --> 08:04.290
You won't stay by my side either?

08:06.560 --> 08:07.830
<i>If I didn't win...</i>

08:07.830 --> 08:09.750
<i>there was no place for me!</i>

08:12.000 --> 08:13.050
<i>And yet...</i>

08:13.420 --> 08:14.880
<i>there you were again.</i>

08:17.300 --> 08:20.060
I'm assigning Dariel as your aide.

08:20.800 --> 08:25.560
The greatest stroke of luck 
in my life was meeting Dariel.

08:25.930 --> 08:28.820
Passing such good fortune on to you...

08:28.820 --> 08:31.050
is how I celebrate your 
taking up this position.

08:31.980 --> 08:33.520
My sons,

08:33.520 --> 08:35.210
help each other.

08:36.070 --> 08:41.450
<i>Father... Is it wrong for 
me to stand at your side?</i>

08:43.020 --> 08:44.480
<i>Lord Bashbarza...</i>

08:47.270 --> 08:48.840
I...

08:49.490 --> 08:50.960
have to win...

08:51.680 --> 08:55.090
or else my life is worth nothing!

08:55.680 --> 08:56.840
<i>This boy...</i>

08:56.840 --> 08:58.390
<i>has been alone all this time.</i>

08:59.650 --> 09:01.890
<i>Why didn't I see that?</i>

09:02.600 --> 09:04.100
<i>What should I do?</i>

09:04.510 --> 09:05.820
Be quiet...

09:06.330 --> 09:07.520
Be quiet!

09:08.900 --> 09:10.860
<i>Did he hear my thoughts?</i>

09:11.200 --> 09:15.610
Don't... feel sorry for me!

09:16.350 --> 09:18.640
<i>The Spirit Synchronization Magic.</i>

09:18.640 --> 09:20.620
<i>He can hear my thoughts too?</i>

09:20.880 --> 09:21.700
<i>If so, then...</i>

09:25.850 --> 09:29.940
Lord Granbarza was always worried about you!

09:31.170 --> 09:37.090
How could you... understand how I feel?

09:38.000 --> 09:40.100
I know someone a lot like you!

09:40.580 --> 09:43.060
The previous Hero, Mister Alantsil!

09:43.970 --> 09:47.820
He believed that his son, me, 
was stolen by Lord Granbarza!

09:48.800 --> 09:49.750
And I, too...

09:50.820 --> 09:51.740
was always...

09:53.210 --> 09:54.230
troubled.

09:58.540 --> 10:02.200
Because I wasn't really family.

10:03.490 --> 10:05.450
And I couldn't use magic.

10:06.690 --> 10:08.240
So the least I could do...

10:08.240 --> 10:10.710
was try not to cause problems for him.

10:11.560 --> 10:13.210
All I could do was smile.

10:15.450 --> 10:17.010
Until I met you.

10:19.120 --> 10:23.260
Rely on him like an older brother, and 
listen to him like you would me.

10:25.530 --> 10:26.520
An older brother?

10:28.510 --> 10:29.520
When I met you,

10:30.470 --> 10:34.340
I became an older brother, 
and Lord Granbarza became my father.

10:35.150 --> 10:37.180
Unbreakable bonds...

10:37.180 --> 10:38.580
A place to belong...

10:38.580 --> 10:40.390
A feeling of safety... 
I received all those things!

10:43.240 --> 10:46.040
Please don't say that your 
life is worth nothing.

10:47.150 --> 10:49.620
Just as you were for me as a child...

10:51.010 --> 10:53.690
this time, I will be a support for you!

10:54.280 --> 10:56.880
For as long as it takes for you to feel safe!

10:57.620 --> 10:58.500
So, please...

11:01.840 --> 11:05.700
Back then, if I hadn't been so stubborn...

11:05.700 --> 11:07.920
If I'd taken your hand...

11:09.960 --> 11:11.490
would things have been better?

11:28.420 --> 11:29.740
It isn't too late.

11:42.760 --> 11:43.760
Lord Bashbarza?

11:44.000 --> 11:45.130
This is...

11:56.560 --> 11:58.090
What's going on?

11:58.550 --> 12:00.320
That lizard thing...

12:00.740 --> 12:05.110
It's consuming Lord Bashbarza's 
wide-range annihilation magic!

12:08.850 --> 12:10.460
Has the hex broken?

12:13.800 --> 12:15.300
That's hot!

12:15.300 --> 12:16.320
Is this...

12:16.890 --> 12:19.080
the magical beast's true power?

12:20.790 --> 12:21.670
This is bad!

12:30.020 --> 12:31.390
Bashbarza?!

12:35.170 --> 12:38.610
D-Don't! That hex is too dangerous!

12:44.870 --> 12:47.780
That's... the Body Fusion hex.

12:48.370 --> 12:50.850
He'll be able to control the 
magical beast for a short time,

12:50.850 --> 12:54.070
but it will soon go on a 
rampage, and he'll be absorbed!

12:54.640 --> 12:56.040
No, that's just...

12:58.980 --> 13:02.540
Looks like I have to pay... my debts.

13:03.480 --> 13:05.800
But here at the end...

13:08.240 --> 13:09.950
I'm glad we were able to talk.

13:17.640 --> 13:18.850
Father!

13:22.060 --> 13:23.290
Father!

13:28.060 --> 13:29.660
Fearsome Emperor's...

13:29.660 --> 13:31.300
Sky Rend!

13:36.080 --> 13:37.260
Bashbarza.

13:37.850 --> 13:38.710
I'm home.

13:39.040 --> 13:40.270
Father!

13:57.950 --> 13:59.200
You idiot.

14:02.800 --> 14:04.060
I'm sorry.

14:14.080 --> 14:17.080
<b>Chillin'
 in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

14:20.070 --> 14:22.840
Don't you think you got a little too excited?

14:23.320 --> 14:24.600
It's fine.

14:24.600 --> 14:27.840
Dariel has worked really hard!

14:30.380 --> 14:32.850
Mothers really are strong, aren't they?

14:35.640 --> 14:36.350
Huh?

14:37.100 --> 14:38.340
Malika!

14:38.850 --> 14:39.920
I'm home!

14:40.400 --> 14:42.360
Husband!

14:43.220 --> 14:45.110
<i>I haven't seen this astounding 
acceleration in a while!</i>

14:45.560 --> 14:48.110
<i>No, it's even more impressive than usual.</i>

14:48.510 --> 14:50.860
<i>What do I do? Block using Guard?</i>

14:52.000 --> 14:54.220
<i>No, I'll just embrace it.</i>

14:55.480 --> 14:56.090
Huh?

14:57.490 --> 14:58.900
Welcome back.

15:01.970 --> 15:02.940
I'm home.

15:08.780 --> 15:12.360
Big Bro!

15:15.050 --> 15:19.890
I thought I had warned you once.

15:20.570 --> 15:23.150
You've made quite a mess.

15:23.500 --> 15:25.100
My deepest apologies.

15:25.760 --> 15:28.990
I am prepared to accept 
whatever punishment is necessary.

15:28.990 --> 15:31.500
"Prepared," are you?

15:33.740 --> 15:36.510
Look down for a moment.

15:40.770 --> 15:41.760
This is...

15:41.760 --> 15:43.290
It's hell.

15:44.260 --> 15:49.210
Those are previous members of the Four Generals
who have committed crimes, as you have.

15:49.580 --> 15:54.260
They've screamed and suffered 
like that for hundreds of years.

15:54.840 --> 15:57.260
I will give you a choice.

15:57.720 --> 16:02.770
Will you start over as one of the 
Four Generals, or will you fall into hell?

16:03.000 --> 16:06.970
You are still young, after all, 
and you regret what you did.

16:06.970 --> 16:08.800
Giving you another chance wouldn't be—

16:08.800 --> 16:11.870
I thank you for your mercy.

16:13.060 --> 16:13.980
However,

16:15.520 --> 16:17.530
I choose hell.

16:19.280 --> 16:20.540
Why?

16:20.920 --> 16:23.870
What I have done is unforgivable.

16:24.880 --> 16:26.950
If I try to escape those crimes...

16:27.670 --> 16:29.180
then nothing will change.

16:34.560 --> 16:36.240
How boring.

16:36.240 --> 16:39.960
I was going to let you be happy 
for a moment and then drop you in.

16:41.130 --> 16:42.810
But now I won't.

16:43.660 --> 16:44.960
Disappear.

16:44.960 --> 16:45.810
What?

16:45.810 --> 16:47.560
Banishment. You're being banished.

16:48.260 --> 16:51.390
Just like when you fired Dariel.

16:52.870 --> 16:53.570
Yes, sire.

17:05.550 --> 17:07.080
Lord Bashbarza!

17:07.280 --> 17:09.120
Lord Bashbarza!

17:21.710 --> 17:22.890
Coming!

17:24.650 --> 17:25.620
Oh my.

17:27.130 --> 17:28.420
Welcome!

17:28.420 --> 17:30.360
Come in! Come in!

17:34.300 --> 17:36.640
Did everything go well with the Demon King?

17:37.200 --> 17:38.620
Somehow, we managed.

17:38.620 --> 17:40.240
Oh, allow me to introduce you.

17:40.240 --> 17:41.150
This is my son, Gran.

17:41.150 --> 17:43.120
Bashbarza of the Four Generals.

17:43.830 --> 17:48.120
Your rampage has caused tremendous 
damage to the Mythril Mine,

17:49.020 --> 17:51.050
and many were injured.

17:55.490 --> 17:56.460
I have...

17:58.800 --> 18:02.510
I have done things to so 
many which cannot be undone.

18:05.680 --> 18:07.330
I am deeply sorry.

18:09.970 --> 18:11.020
I also...

18:11.640 --> 18:13.180
offer my apologies.

18:18.050 --> 18:19.530
You're awake now, Gran?

18:22.080 --> 18:23.540
Huh? You want to be held?

18:23.840 --> 18:25.100
Once again,

18:25.100 --> 18:26.540
this is my son, Gran.

18:27.040 --> 18:28.540
Please hold him.

18:28.850 --> 18:31.310
Um... How do I...

18:31.310 --> 18:34.550
You support his back and 
bottom like this and...

18:34.820 --> 18:36.840
Gran! Gran!

18:36.000 --> 18:36.840
Gran,

18:36.840 --> 18:38.680
this is your big brother, Bashbarza.

18:39.020 --> 18:40.000
Ba...

18:41.180 --> 18:42.870
Bashu...

18:42.870 --> 18:44.720
baazaa...

18:45.030 --> 18:47.810
Big Brother Bashbaaza!

18:49.400 --> 18:50.690
An older brother?

18:52.810 --> 18:54.190
<i>When I met you,</i>

18:54.730 --> 18:58.700
<i>I became an older brother, 
and Lord Granbarza became my father.</i>

18:59.680 --> 19:01.230
<i>Unbreakable bonds...</i>

19:01.840 --> 19:02.860
<i>A place to belong...</i>

19:03.450 --> 19:05.320
<i>A feeling of safety... 
I received all those things!</i>

19:09.350 --> 19:13.210
If it's possible... I want 
to atone for my crimes.

19:14.480 --> 19:16.210
Because all of you...

19:17.780 --> 19:19.430
are precious to my older brother.

19:21.720 --> 19:23.450
L-Looking forward to it,

19:23.450 --> 19:24.950
my second Big Bro!

19:25.630 --> 19:28.470
He's like a younger brother 
to me. His name is Gashita.

19:29.020 --> 19:30.720
N-Nice to meet—

19:30.720 --> 19:31.730
Big Bro!

19:34.220 --> 19:35.230
You...

19:35.550 --> 19:37.650
were trying to find it too, weren't you?

19:38.240 --> 19:39.730
Your own answer.

19:40.450 --> 19:43.230
I don't dislike that sort of sentiment.

19:44.710 --> 19:48.700
That's the first time Gran 
has said anyone's name.

19:49.460 --> 19:51.370
Is it all right that it was me?

19:51.370 --> 19:52.460
Of course!

19:52.950 --> 19:55.630
Today has become a happy day to remember!

19:56.290 --> 19:58.730
A day to remember? That's it!

19:58.730 --> 19:59.710
Gashita...

20:00.100 --> 20:01.540
Can I ask you for one of those?

20:01.540 --> 20:02.700
Any time!

20:12.240 --> 20:13.440
Wow! Speed painting!

20:13.440 --> 20:14.760
It's the power of love!

20:14.760 --> 20:15.740
I see.

20:17.480 --> 20:19.690
I prepared the eyepatch in a hurry.

20:20.310 --> 20:22.700
Would a more stylish one have been better?

20:24.500 --> 20:26.600
No. This one is good.

20:27.320 --> 20:28.450
Thank you.

20:30.820 --> 20:32.960
Today has become a wonderful day to remember.

20:33.900 --> 20:35.970
The day Gran spoke a name...

20:36.810 --> 20:38.880
...and the day our whole family came together.

20:45.910 --> 20:46.470
Excuse me!

20:47.040 --> 20:48.920
Dariel, do you have a moment?

20:48.920 --> 20:49.680
Yes!

20:49.680 --> 20:52.090
Mayor, can I have a moment too?

20:52.090 --> 20:54.540
Yes, of course! I'm coming right now!

21:00.810 --> 21:01.600
Wow!

21:01.600 --> 21:03.420
Hurry! Hurry!

21:20.320 --> 21:22.630
Lord Bashbarza, you're leaving already?

21:23.350 --> 21:25.680
You could stay and relax for longer.

21:26.360 --> 21:28.140
I know. Thank you.

21:28.580 --> 21:30.390
What will you do now?

21:30.920 --> 21:32.020
First,

21:32.020 --> 21:35.640
I'd like to return what 
I can to those I've hurt.

21:36.080 --> 21:38.650
After that, I want to 
travel around the world.

21:39.160 --> 21:41.420
All the things my brother holds dear,

21:41.420 --> 21:43.040
I want to see them with my own eyes.

21:44.080 --> 21:46.780
Because I want to be like my older brother.

21:47.600 --> 21:50.160
<i>It's a little embarrassing to be 
told that face-to-face, but...</i>

21:51.840 --> 21:53.910
I am rooting for you more than anyone else.

21:57.970 --> 21:59.170
Bash!

21:59.730 --> 22:01.420
Here! I packed you a lunch!

22:01.970 --> 22:03.690
Eat lots, all right?

22:03.690 --> 22:05.920
Thank you, Malika.

22:07.930 --> 22:08.680
Well, then...

22:09.990 --> 22:11.150
I'll be going.

23:26.420 --> 23:28.790
I'll go hunt something down for dinner.

23:28.790 --> 23:29.900
Husband!

23:32.360 --> 23:37.240
Today, let's work as hard 
as we can, together!

23:39.990 --> 23:41.830
<i>It started in this village.</i>

23:42.270 --> 23:44.150
<i>My second life...</i>

23:45.610 --> 23:48.000
<i>And it will continue.</i>

23:48.000 --> 23:58.000

